From: Antoine Martin <dev@ayakael.net>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:33:40 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 021/107] device-clockworkpi-uconsole-radxa-cm5: move to
 linux-postmarketos-rockchip kernel

Other changes:
 * removed openrc subpackage as not needed
 * added CWU50 panel init hook as workaround to kernel bug
 * added boot-deploy hook to gunzip vmlinuz as vendor u-boot does not support
   compressed kernels
 * send output from serial2 (pin 33-35 - the extension port) to serial4
   (pin 19,23 - GPIO header)

Part-of: <https://gitlab.nura.eco/nura/pmaports/-/merge_requests/8285>
